#####################
### Oort Specific ###
#####################

# OORT_APP_ROUTE_BASE: Change this if you want to run this application to appear as if it runs out of a subdirectory 
# of your server. E.g. instead of haviging the routes "/foo" and "/bar", you can add a 
# system-wide prefix that sets them to "/myapp/foo" and "/myapp/bar" by setting this to "/myapp".
